From 8d84465f98f885e7d9bdf055f1869c35a0ea6bef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robbie Cao <robbie.cao@arm.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Oct 2023 13:27:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] scp-firmware: Abstract scp-firmware common code for all

This commit squashes all the downstream patches of RD-Fremont from
v2.13.0 to RD-INFRA-2023.09.28.

In future, this commit will be removed once we upgrade to scp-firmware
master branch where RD-Fremont code is upstreamed.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate
